      counters: []
    pages:
    - 'My job at city hall, in one sentence: somebody wants a permit, I give them a form, they fill it in wrong, they go home, they come back.'
    - Bring a sandwich. Bring a book. Bring a second sandwich, for me. I mean it.
    happy: 0
