  - title: Half-time
    number: 3
    heartsNeeded: 3
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - 'Big news: I''ve signed you up for the Suburb Cup squad. Reserves. Don''t argue, it''s already in pen.'
    - 'Your first job as a reserve: half-time fruit. Coaches are supposed to give out oranges, but nobody grows oranges round here. Six apples. Sliced is a bonus.'
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ac67ad7bf2de88441b45e9cfe51c91bf, type: 2}
      amount: 6
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: Half-time apples
      questText: 'Lucia has signed you up as a reserve for the Suburb Cup squad. Your first job: bring six apples for half-time.'
      reminder:
      - Got the half-time apples? Six. The kids get very grumpy without fruit. So do I.
      thanks:
      - Perfect! Look at the colour!
      - You're officially part of the team now. Here, a reserve's wages. Don't spend it all at once.
    choice:
      enabled: 0
      optionA: 
      replyA: []
      flagsA: []
      optionB: 
      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 100
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: City hall jobs
    number: 4
    heartsNeeded: 4
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - You know those odd jobs on the city hall board? I write half of them. The good half.
    - Clearing drains, fixing benches, cleaning up the river bank. The tower writes the other half, and those are all 'deliver this leaflet about how clean the river is'.
    - Take mine. Always take mine.
