  - title: Inside or outside
    number: 8
    heartsNeeded: 8
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - There's an election for city council in the spring. Sterling has a candidate. Smart suit, big smile, posters everywhere.
    - Nobody's standing against him. Gus says I should. Grace says I should. Marcus says I should and then looks sick.
    - Or I stay at my desk, where I can do the most good quietly. Things get lost on desks all the time. Forms slip behind filing cabinets. It happens.
    - You've seen me shout at nine-year-olds about passing. Am I a councillor, or am I a very good desk?
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 1
      optionA: Run for council
      replyA:
      - Council it is! I'm going to need posters. And a slogan. 'Pass the ball, Sterling'? No. Mateo will help.
      - Oh no. I'm going to have to do speeches. I'll treat it like a team talk. Shouting and oranges.
      flagsA:
      - lucia_running
      optionB: Lose the paperwork
      replyB:
      - The desk. Quietly.
      - Do you know how big the gap is behind the filing cabinet on the third floor? I measured it today. It's perfect.
      flagsB:
      - lucia_lost_forms
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Campaign days
    number: 9
    heartsNeeded: 9
    path: 1
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
